      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 1008,
        "content": "✉️ Sending the newsletter\nFormats the AI output into a ready-to-send email and delivers it\nvia Gmail to the specified recipient.\n\n⚠️ Setup: This node requires a Gmail account connection.\n1. Open the \"Send a message\" node\n2. Under Credentials, click \"Create New\" → \"Gmail OAuth2\"\n3. Sign in with your Google account and grant access\n4. Set the recipient email address in the node parameters"
