        "content": "🤖 AI content rewriting\nThe AI Agent (Google Gemini) rewrites the articles into a\nconsistent, readable newsletter format — shortening, unifying tone,\nand removing unnecessary details.\n\n⚠️ Setup: This node requires a Google Gemini API key.\n1. Open the \"Google Gemini Model\" node\n2. Under Credentials, click \"Create New\"\n3. Paste your API key from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey"
